# What NOT to upload when deploying from the repo root (both the Vercel Git
# integration and `vercel deploy` run from here). Only two things matter to the
# deployment: the static dashboard in web/ (see `outputDirectory` in
# vercel.json) and the serverless functions in api/ — everything below is the
# device app and its tooling, which would otherwise be uploaded on every deploy.
target
crates
installer
mcp
scripts
supabase
ci
docs
.github
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
Cross.toml
ROADMAP.md
CLAUDE.md

# Web test tooling: not part of the site. `web/package.json` in particular is
# excluded so Vercel doesn't decide this is a Node build.
web/node_modules
web/package.json
web/package-lock.json
web/playwright.config.js
web/api-tests
web/tests
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/blob-report
web/README.md
web/.env*
web/.vercel
